  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p01053",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“是呵，现在已经无法再挽回喽……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yes, it is already too late to undo it now...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p01053",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "有一天，忽然醒过来一看，村里一个人也没有了，只留下了我们……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "One day, when we suddenly woke up and looked around, there was not a single person left in the village, only us...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p01053",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我知道得可清楚呢……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I know it perfectly clearly...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p01053",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "真的呢……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is true...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p01053",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "不久，肯定会变成那样的……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Before long, it will surely turn out that way...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p01053",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "等你意识到被抛弃，已经晚喽……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "By the time you realize you have been abandoned, it will already be too late...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p01053",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "尽心尽力到这个份上，将来只能被当做笑柄……”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After putting your heart and soul into it this much, in the end you will only be made a laughingstock...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
